#: ../../architecture.rst:2
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "アーキテクチャ"

#: ../../architecture.rst:4
msgid ""
"This guide provides a detailed overview of the Tiny8 CPU architecture, "
"including its registers, memory model, instruction execution, and status "
"flags."
msgstr "本ガイドでは、レジスタ、メモリモデル、命令実行、ステータスフラグなど、Tiny8 CPUアーキテクチャの詳細な概要を解説します。"

#: ../../architecture.rst:7
msgid "CPU Overview"
msgstr "CPU概要"

#: ../../architecture.rst:9
msgid ""
"Tiny8 implements an 8-bit RISC CPU architecture modeled directly after "
"the Atmel / Microchip AVR instruction set architecture. Instruction "
"semantics, flag behaviors, and operations strictly adhere to the official"
" specification:"
msgstr ""
"Tiny8は、Atmel / Microchip AVR命令セットアーキテクチャを忠実にモデル化した8ビットRISC "
"CPUアーキテクチャを実装しています。命令の動作仕様、フラグ動作、演算仕様は公式仕様に厳密に準拠しています:"

#: ../../architecture.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Official Specification**: `Microchip AVR® Instruction Set Manual "
"(DS40002198A) <https://ww1.microchip.com/downloads/en/DeviceDoc/AVR-"
"Instruction-Set-Manual-DS40002198A.pdf>`_"
msgstr ""
"**公式仕様書**: `Microchip AVR® Instruction Set Manual (DS40002198A) "
"<https://ww1.microchip.com/downloads/en/DeviceDoc/AVR-Instruction-Set-"
"Manual-DS40002198A.pdf>`_"

#: ../../architecture.rst:13
msgid ""
"The design balances hardware realism with educational clarity, providing "
"full visibility and interactive step debugging."
msgstr "ハードウェアの現実性と教育的な分かりやすさを両立し、高い可視性とインタラクティブなステップ実行デバッグを提供します。"

#: ../../architecture.rst:16
msgid "Key Specifications"
msgstr "主要仕様"

#: ../../architecture.rst:18
msgid "**Word size**: 8 bits"
msgstr "**ワード長**: 8ビット"

#: ../../architecture.rst:19
msgid "**Registers**: 32 general-purpose 8-bit registers (R0-R31)"
msgstr "**レジスタ**: 32本の8ビット汎用レジスタ (R0-R31)"

#: ../../architecture.rst:20
msgid "**Memory**: 64KB RAM (configurable)"
msgstr "**メモリ**: 64KB RAM (設定変更可能)"

#: ../../architecture.rst:21
msgid "**Stack**: Grows downward from high memory (SP decrements on push)"
msgstr "**スタック**: 高位アドレスから下位へ伸長 (プッシュ時にSPがデクリメント)"

#: ../../architecture.rst:22
msgid "**Instruction set**: 67 instructions compliant with AVR DS40002198A"
msgstr "**命令セット**: AVR DS40002198A準拠の67命令"

#: ../../architecture.rst:23
msgid "**Status register**: 8 flags (SREG: I, T, H, S, V, N, Z, C)"
msgstr "**ステータスレジスタ**: 8個の条件フラグ (SREG: I, T, H, S, V, N, Z, C)"

#: ../../architecture.rst:26
msgid "Register Architecture"
msgstr "レジスタアーキテクチャ"

#: ../../architecture.rst:28
msgid ""
"In strict alignment with the **Microchip AVR® Instruction Set Manual "
"(DS40002198A, Section 4)**, the CPU register file consists of 32 8-bit "
"general-purpose working registers, labeled **R0** through **R31**. All 32"
" registers have direct, single-cycle access to the Arithmetic Logic Unit "
"(ALU)."
msgstr ""
"**Microchip AVR® Instruction Set Manual (DS40002198A, 第4章)** "
"に厳密に準拠し、CPUのレジスタファイルは **R0** から **R31** "
"までの32本の8ビット汎用作業レジスタで構成されます。全32本のレジスタが算術論理演算装置 (ALU) へ直接アクセス可能です。"

#: ../../architecture.rst:45
msgid "Register Organization & Special Functions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:47
msgid ""
"**General Working Registers (R0–R15)**: Operate with all two-register "
"arithmetic, logical, and bit operations (e.g., ``ADD``, ``SUB``, ``AND``,"
" ``OR``, ``EOR``, ``MOV``, ``CP``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Upper Registers (R16–R31)**: Support direct immediate instructions "
"(``LDI``, ``SUBI``, ``SBCI``, ``ANDI``, ``ORI``, ``CPI``) where an 8-bit "
"constant :math:`K` is supplied in the instruction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:51
msgid ""
"**16-bit Word Operand Pairs (R25:R24, X, Y, Z)**: The word operations "
"``ADIW`` (Add Immediate to Word) and ``SBIW`` (Subtract Immediate from "
"Word) operate exclusively on the upper register pairs: * ``R25:R24`` * "
"``R27:R26`` (X-register) * ``R29:R28`` (Y-register) * ``R31:R30`` "
"(Z-register)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:57
msgid ""
"**16-bit Pointer Registers (X, Y, Z)**: Six registers (R26–R31) serve as "
"three 16-bit indirect address pointers for Data Space memory addressing: "
"* **X-register**: ``XL = R26`` (low byte), ``XH = R27`` (high byte) * "
"**Y-register**: ``YL = R28`` (low byte), ``YH = R29`` (high byte) * "
"**Z-register**: ``ZL = R30`` (low byte), ``ZH = R31`` (high byte)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:64
msgid "Special Registers"
msgstr "特殊レジスタ"

#: ../../architecture.rst:67
msgid "Program Counter (PC)"
msgstr "プログラムカウンタ (PC)"

#: ../../architecture.rst:69
msgid "16-bit program address pointer referencing instructions in program memory."
msgstr "プログラムメモリ上の命令を参照する16ビットのアドレスポインタです。"

#: ../../architecture.rst:70
msgid "Automatically increments during sequential execution."
msgstr "通常の逐次実行中は自動的にインクリメントされます。"

#: ../../architecture.rst:71
msgid ""
"Modified by jump (``JMP``, ``RJMP``), subroutine call/return (``CALL``, "
"``RCALL``, ``RET``, ``RETI``), skip instructions (``CPSE``, ``SBRS``, "
"``SBRC``, ``SBIS``, ``SBIC``), and conditional branches (``BRxx``)."
msgstr ""
"ジャンプ命令 (``JMP``, ``RJMP``)、サブルーチン呼び出し/復帰 (``CALL``, ``RCALL``, ``RET``, "
"``RETI``)、スキップ命令 (``CPSE``, ``SBRS``, ``SBRC``, ``SBIS``, "
"``SBIC``)、および条件分岐命令 (``BRxx``) によって更新されます。"

#: ../../architecture.rst:74
msgid "Stack Pointer (SP)"
msgstr "スタックポインタ (SP)"

#: ../../architecture.rst:76
msgid ""
"16-bit stack pointer pointing to the current top of the stack in Data "
"SRAM."
msgstr "データSRAM内の現在のスタックトップを指す16ビットのポインタです。"

#: ../../architecture.rst:77
msgid "Initialized to the end of RAM (default: ``0xFFFF`` with 64KB RAM)."
msgstr "RAMの末尾アドレスに初期化されます (64KB RAMの場合、デフォルトは ``0xFFFF``)。"

#: ../../architecture.rst:78
msgid "Decrements during ``PUSH``, ``CALL``, and ``RCALL`` (post-decrement)."
msgstr "``PUSH``, ``CALL``, ``RCALL`` の実行時にデクリメントされます (後置デクリメント)。"

#: ../../architecture.rst:79
msgid "Increments during ``POP``, ``RET``, and ``RETI`` (pre-increment)."
msgstr "``POP``, ``RET``, ``RETI`` の実行時にインクリメントされます (前置インクリメント)。"

#: ../../architecture.rst:82
msgid "Status Register (SREG)"
msgstr "ステータスレジスタ (SREG)"

#: ../../architecture.rst:84
msgid ""
"8-bit condition flag register containing flags: ``I``, ``T``, ``H``, "
"``S``, ``V``, ``N``, ``Z``, ``C``."
msgstr ""
"条件フラグ ``I``, ``T``, ``H``, ``S``, ``V``, ``N``, ``Z``, ``C`` "
"を格納する8ビットレジスタです。"

#: ../../architecture.rst:85
msgid ""
"Updated by arithmetic, logical, and shift operations according to exact "
"Boolean algebra defined in DS40002198A."
msgstr "DS40002198Aで定義された厳密なブール代数に基づき、算術演算、論理演算、シフト演算によって更新されます。"

#: ../../architecture.rst:93
msgid "Memory Model & Addressing Modes"
msgstr "メモリモデルとアドレッシングモード"

#: ../../architecture.rst:96
msgid "Data Memory Space"
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:98
msgid ""
"Tiny8 provides a flat, byte-addressable memory space modeled after AVR "
"SRAM with configurable capacity (default: 65536 bytes / 64KB, addressable"
" range ``0x0000`` to ``0xFFFF``)."
msgstr ""
"Tiny8は、設定可能な容量を持つAVR SRAMをモデルにしたフラットなバイト単位のアドレス空間を提供します (デフォルト: 65,536バイト"
" / 64KB、アドレス可能範囲 ``0x0000`` から ``0xFFFF``)。"

#: ../../architecture.rst:117
msgid "AVR Addressing Modes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:119
msgid ""
"Tiny8 strictly adheres to the standard AVR addressing modes specified in "
"DS40002198A:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:121
msgid ""
"**Direct Single Register**: Operates on a single working register "
":math:`Rd` (e.g. ``INC Rd``, ``DEC Rd``, ``NEG Rd``, ``COM Rd``, ``CLR "
"Rd``, ``SER Rd``, ``SWAP Rd``, ``LSL Rd``, ``LSR Rd``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:122
msgid ""
"**Direct Two-Register**: Operates on two working registers :math:`Rd` and"
" :math:`Rr` (e.g. ``ADD Rd, Rr``, ``ADC Rd, Rr``, ``SUB Rd, Rr``, ``SBC "
"Rd, Rr``, ``AND Rd, Rr``, ``OR Rd, Rr``, ``EOR Rd, Rr``, ``CP Rd, Rr``, "
"``MOV Rd, Rr``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:123
msgid ""
"**Immediate Addressing**: An 8-bit constant :math:`K` operates on an "
"upper register :math:`R16 \\le Rd \\le R31` (e.g. ``LDI Rd, K``, ``SUBI "
"Rd, K``, ``SBCI Rd, K``, ``ANDI Rd, K``, ``ORI Rd, K``, ``CPI Rd, K``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:124
msgid ""
"**Word Immediate Addressing**: A 6-bit constant :math:`0 \\le K \\le 63` "
"operates on register pairs :math:`R25:R24`, :math:`X`, :math:`Y`, or "
":math:`Z` (e.g. ``ADIW Rd, K``, ``SBIW Rd, K``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:125
msgid ""
"**Direct Data Addressing**: 16-bit absolute memory address :math:`k` "
"loads or stores directly to Data Space (e.g. ``LDS Rd, k``, ``STS k, "
"Rr``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:126
msgid ""
"**Data Indirect Addressing with Pointer Registers (X, Y, Z)**: Accesses "
"Data Space through 16-bit register pointers :math:`X` (R27:R26), "
":math:`Y` (R29:R28), or :math:`Z` (R31:R30) (e.g. ``LD Rd, X``, ``ST X, "
"Rr``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:127
msgid ""
"**I/O Direct Addressing**: Reads or writes to 6-bit I/O addresses "
":math:`0 \\le P \\le 63` (e.g. ``IN Rd, P``, ``OUT P, Rr``, ``SBI P, b``,"
" ``CBI P, b``, ``SBIS P, b``, ``SBIC P, b``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:128
msgid ""
"**Relative Program Addressing**: Jumps or branches relative to the "
"current Program Counter within range :math:`PC + k + 1` (e.g. ``RJMP k``,"
" ``RCALL k``, ``BREQ k``, ``BRNE k``, ``BRCS k``, ``BRCC k``, ``BRLO k``,"
" ``BRSH k``, ``BRGE k``, ``BRLT k``, ``BRMI k``, ``BRPL k``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:129
msgid ""
"**Direct Program Addressing**: Unconditional jump or long subroutine call"
" directly to 16-bit program address :math:`k` (e.g. ``JMP k``, ``CALL "
"k``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:130
msgid ""
"**Indirect Program Addressing**: Return from subroutine or interrupt "
"through return address popped from the stack (e.g. ``RET``, ``RETI``)."
msgstr ""

