#: ../../architecture.rst:213
msgid "**Arithmetic (ADD, ADC, SUB, SUBI, SBC, SBCI)**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:214
msgid "Updates all condition flags: ``H``, ``S``, ``V``, ``N``, ``Z``, ``C``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:216
msgid "**Comparisons (CP, CPI)**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:217
msgid ""
"Identical flag updates to subtraction (``SUB`` / ``SUBI``), but the "
"register value is discarded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:219
msgid "**Bitwise Logical (AND, ANDI, OR, ORI, EOR, TST)**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:220
msgid ""
"Updates ``S``, ``V=0`` (cleared), ``N``, ``Z``. Carry ``C`` and Half-"
"Carry ``H`` are **unaffected** (``-``). ``TST Rd`` is an alias for ``AND "
"Rd, Rd``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:222
msgid "**Register Clearing & Setting (CLR, SER)**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:223
msgid ""
"``CLR Rd`` is an alias for ``EOR Rd, Rd``: sets ``Z=1``, ``S=0``, "
"``V=0``, ``N=0``; leaves ``C`` and ``H`` unaffected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:224
msgid "``SER Rd`` is an alias for ``LDI Rd, $FF``: **no flags affected**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:226
msgid "**Single-Operand Arithmetic (INC, DEC, NEG, COM)**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:227
msgid ""
"``INC`` / ``DEC``: Update ``S``, ``V``, ``N``, ``Z``. Carry ``C`` is "
"**unaffected** (allows loop counters without clobbering carry)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:228
msgid ""
"``NEG``: Two's complement negation (:math:`R = 0 - Rd`). Updates ``H``, "
"``S``, ``V``, ``N``, ``Z``, ``C``. (:math:`C = (R \\neq 0)`, :math:`V = "
"(Rd = \\$80)`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:229
msgid ""
"``COM``: One's complement inversion (:math:`R = \\$FF - Rd`). Updates "
"``S``, ``V=0``, ``N``, ``Z``, and forces ``C=1``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:231
msgid "**Shifts & Rotates (LSL, LSR, ROL, ROR, SWAP)**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:232
msgid "``LSL Rd``: Alias for ``ADD Rd, Rd``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:233
msgid "``ROL Rd``: Alias for ``ADC Rd, Rd``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:234
msgid ""
"``LSR Rd``: Logical shift right. Sets :math:`C = Rd0`, :math:`N = 0`, "
":math:`Z = (R = 0)`, :math:`V = N \\oplus C = C`, :math:`S = N \\oplus V "
"= C`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:235
msgid ""
"``ROR Rd``: Rotate right through carry. Sets :math:`C = Rd0`, :math:`N = "
"R7`, :math:`Z = (R = 0)`, :math:`V = N \\oplus C`, :math:`S = N \\oplus "
"V`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:236
msgid "``SWAP Rd``: Swaps nibbles. **No flags affected**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:238
msgid "**Word Operations (ADIW, SBIW)**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../architecture.rst:239
msgid ""
"16-bit word addition / subtraction on pointer register pairs (R25:R24, "
"R27:R26, R29:R28, R31:R30). Updates ``S``, ``V``, ``N``, ``Z``, ``C``."
msgstr ""

